{"speciesId":287,"names":{"fr":"Parecool","es":"Slakoth","en":"Slakoth","ja":"ナマケロ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SLAKOTH lolls around for over twenty hours every day. Because it moves so little, it does not need much food. This POKéMON’s sole daily meal consists of just three leaves."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SLAKOTH’s heart beats just once a minute. Whatever happens, it is content to loaf around motionless. It is rare to see this POKéMON in motion."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It sleeps virtually all day and night long. It doesn’t change its nest its entire life, but it sometimes travels great distances by swimming in rivers."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It sleeps for 20 hours every day. Making drowsy those that see it is one of its abilities."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It sleeps for 20 hours every day. Making drowsy those that see it is one of its abilities."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The way SLAKOTH lolls around makes anyone who watches it feel like doing the same."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The way SLAKOTH lolls around makes anyone who watches it feel like doing the same."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il passe le plus clair de son temps affalé. Rien qu’à le voir, on a envie de bâiller."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il passe le plus clair de son temps affalé. Rien qu’à le voir, on a envie de bâiller."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If it eats just three leaves in a day, it is satisfied. Other than that, it sleeps for 20 hours a day."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If it eats just three leaves in a day, it is satisfied. Other than that, it sleeps for 20 hours a day."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Rien qu’à voir un Parecool, on n’a plus envie de bouger et on s’endort."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Slakoth se pasa todo el día holgazaneando y solo con verlo a uno le entra mucha pereza."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The way Slakoth lolls around makes anyone who watches it feel like doing the same."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ナマケロの 怠けた 様子は 見ている 人の 怠け心を 存分に 刺激するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il dort 20 heures par jour et ne fait rien d’autre, si ce n’est manger trois ou quatre feuilles dans la journée."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si se come tres hojas al día, ya se queda satisfecho. Aparte de eso, se pasa durmiendo 20 horas al día."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"If it eats just three leaves in a day, it is satisfied. Other than that, it sleeps for 20 hours a day."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"１日に 葉っぱを ３枚も 食べれば 満足で それ以外は ２０時間も 眠っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Parecool se prélasse plus de vingt heures par jour. Il bouge tellement peu qu’il n’a presque pas besoin de manger. Le repas quotidien de ce Pokémon n’est constitué que de trois feuilles."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Slakoth se pasa más de veinte horas al día tumbado. Como se mueve tan poco, necesita muy poca comida. De hecho, la única toma que hace al día la componen tan solo tres hojas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Slakoth lolls around for over 20 hours every day. Because it moves so little, it does not need much food. This Pokémon’s sole daily meal consists of just three leaves."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"１日 ２０時間 以上 寝そべっている。 ほとんど 体を 動かさないので 葉っぱを ３枚 食べれば １日の 食事が 終わる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le cœur de Parecool ne bat qu’une fois par minute. Quoi qu’il arrive, il se contente de s’avachir, immobile. Il est très rare de voir ce Pokémon se déplacer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A Slakoth le late el corazón una vez por minuto. Ya puede pasar lo que pase, que este Pokémon no mueve un dedo. Está todo el día holgazaneando. Es muy raro verlo en movimiento."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Slakoth’s heart beats just once a minute. Whatever happens, it is content to loaf around motionless. It is rare to see this Pokémon in motion."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"心臓の 鼓動は １分間に １回。 とにかく じっと 寝そべっている ポケモンで 動く 姿を 見ることは ほとんど ない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":287,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0